  "View your available model quota and AI credits. Model quota refreshes periodically based on your plan. Enable AI Credit Overages to continue using models when your quota is exhausted.": "檢視您可用的模型配額和 AI 點數。模型配額會根據您的方案定期刷新。啟用 AI 點數超額使用，以便在配額耗盡時繼續使用模型。",
