  "Warning": "警告",
  "When enabled, Agent is given awareness of lint errors created by its edits and may fix them without explicit user prompting.": "啟用後，代理將能感知其修改產生的程式碼檢查 (Lint) 錯誤，並可能在不詢問使用者的情況下自動修復。",
  "When enabled, agent is given awareness of lint errors created by its edits and may fix them without explicit user prompting.": "啟用後，代理將能感知其編輯所產生的 Lint 錯誤，並可在未經使用者明確提示的情況下嘗試修復。",
  "When toggled on, Antigravity will use your AI credits to fulfill model requests once you're out of model quota. Antigravity will always use your model quota first before using AI credits.": "開啟後，當您的模型配額耗盡時，反重力智慧程式設計將使用您的 AI 點數來滿足模型要求。反重力智慧程式設計一律先使用您的模型配額，再使用 AI 點數。",
  "Within each group, models share a weekly limit and a 5-hour limit. Quota is consumed proportionally to the cost of the tokens. Thus, limits will last longer with shorter tasks or using more cost-effective models. The 5-hour limit smooths out aggregate demand to fairly distribute global capacity across all users, while your weekly limit is tied directly to your individual tier.": "在每個群組內，模型共享每週限制和 5 小時限制。配額的消耗與 Token 的成本成正比。因此，透過較短的任務或使用更具性價比的模型，限制額度可以維持得更久。5 小時限制可以平滑總體需求，以便在所有使用者之間公平分配全局容量，而您的每週限制則直接與您的個人層級掛鉤。",
  "Within each group, models share a weekly limit. Quota is consumed proportionally to the cost of the tokens. Thus, limits will last longer with shorter tasks or using more cost-effective models. Your weekly limit is tied directly to your individual tier.": "同一分組內的模型共享每週額度。額度按 token 成本比例消耗，因此任務越短或使用價效比越高的模型，額度持續越久。每週額度與你的個人層級直接掛鉤。",
